{"id": "46091", "title": "狂风暴雨", "author": "色狼拒艳", "category": "其他类型", "count": 25, "available": 25, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/46/46091.htm", "intro": "陈夫人停止了臀部的扭动，微微将自己的臀部抬起，缓缓向后移去，当移到狂风的“金枪”上面时停了下来，双手将自己的蜜穴用力扒开，对准“枪头”坐了下去。这一路行来很是辛苦，因为狂风的宝贝实在是大。还好刚才的热身使她的蜜穴变的滑润了，才使“金枪”顺利的进入。接着双手按在狂风的小腹上，快速的上下扭动臀部。", "base": "files/article/html/46/46091", "chapters": [{"title": "全文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第01章 深夜惊魂", "file": "6274990.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第02章 陈氏老大", "file": "6274991.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第03章 宝刀未老", "file": "6274992.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第04章 江湖有变", "file": "6274993.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第05章 病房艳事", "file": "6274994.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第06章 欢乐之夜", "file": "6274995.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第07章 缘定终生", "file": "6274996.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第08章 校园遭险", "file": "6274997.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第09章 快感", "file": "6274998.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章 黄丽", "file": "6274999.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第11章 陈夫人", "file": "6275000.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第12章 黄色影碟", "file": "6275001.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第13章 钟红", "file": "6275002.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第14章 年少有为", "file": "6275003.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第15章 豪门宴会", "file": "6275004.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第16章 老大之死", "file": "6275005.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第17章 淫娃荡妇", "file": "6275006.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第18章 力助美女", "file": "6275007.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第19章 小场风波", "file": "6275008.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第20章 农村姑娘", "file": "6275009.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第21章 性理治疗", "file": "6275010.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第22章 家中飘香", "file": "6275011.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第23章 调情圣手", "file": "6275012.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第24章 黑帮乱淫", "file": "6275013.html"